From a3fd6cccf58fac6546423d4152774e2cf9edf714 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 08:53:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] infiniti: camera: add the singleblur license to the
 extract list

The singleblur person-seg engine validates odm/etc/camera/singleblur/
license_release.license at load; the blob was staged vendor-side but
never declared here, so a regeneration would drop it. Declare it next
to the other singleblur payloads.

Regenerates: proprietary_vendor_oneplus_infiniti "infiniti: camera:
ship singleblur person-seg license".

(cherry picked from commit 8833551bac716616afa0e2882305af95851813d2)
---
 proprietary-files.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/proprietary-files.txt b/proprietary-files.txt
index 8d65760..6e5f9f2 100644
--- a/proprietary-files.txt
+++ b/proprietary-files.txt
@@ -747,6 +747,7 @@ odm/etc/camera/pfb_bin/ThirdPartyPreSkintuneBinary.bin
 odm/etc/camera/pfb_bin/ThirdPartyPreSkintuneMRTBinary.bin
 odm/etc/camera/pfb_bin/ThirdPartyPreVertFilterBinary.bin
 odm/etc/camera/pfb_bin/ThirdPartyPreVertSurBinary.bin
+odm/etc/camera/singleblur/license_release.license
 odm/etc/camera/singleblur/personseg.bin
 odm/etc/camera/singleblur/preview_seg.json
 odm/etc/camera/sticker/material/animoji/data.zip
